<title>NEW ZEALAND: Alistair Nicholson appointed MD at Ord Minnett NZ.</title>
<headline>Alistair Nicholson appointed MD at Ord Minnett NZ.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alistair Nicholson has been appointed managing director of Ord Minnett New Zealand, the brokerage house told Reuters on Monday.</p>
<p>Nicholson would take up the position, left vacant since Robert Morrison was named Bankers Trust NZ chief executive in March, from mid-August, a senior broker said.</p>
<p>Nicholson comes from Lehman Brothers in Hong Kong, where he was head of equity trading and derivatives in Southeast Asia.</p>
<p>--Wellington Newsroom (64 4) 4734746</p>
